{"unit_id": "tag:03SB:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节的目标是证明曲线（curves）上扭（torsion）层（sheaves）的上同调（cohomology）的基本有限性（finiteness）和消失性结果，参见定理<REF_0001>。在第<REF_0002>节，我们将讨论可构造层（constructible sheaves），其为 Noether 环（Noetherian ring）上的扭（torsion）模（modules）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "curves", "target_term": "曲线"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "扭"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "finiteness", "target_term": "有限性"}, {"source_term": "constructible sheaves", "target_term": "可构造层"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "Noether 环"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "扭"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "curves", "target_term": "曲线", "context": "本节空间。"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "扭", "context": "层和模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "本节涉及的层。"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调", "context": "本节主题。"}, {"source_term": "finiteness", "target_term": "有限性", "context": "要证明的性质。"}, {"source_term": "constructible sheaves", "target_term": "可构造层", "context": "后续讨论的层。"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "Noether 环", "context": "模的系数环。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "后续讨论的模。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0A52:statement", "translation": "这里<MATH_0001>是代数闭（algebraically closed）域（field），<MATH_0002>是分离（separated）、有限型（finite type）概形（scheme），维数（dimension）为<MATH_0003>，定义于<MATH_0004>上，而<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>上的扭（torsion）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraically closed", "target_term": "代数闭"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "扭"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraically closed", "target_term": "代数闭", "context": "基域性质。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "基域。"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "设定空间。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "空间维数。"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "扭", "context": "层性质。"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "设定的层。"}], "notes": []}
